  "question": "Where can I find a golf course within 150 kilometers, oriented toward the northwest of Appalachian Wireless Arena, Pikeville, KY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.517286 37.477755)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.517286 37.477755)',4326)::geography, 150000)\nAND leisure = 'golf_course'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 292.5 AND 337.5;\n",
